<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE score-partwise PUBLIC "-//Recordare//DTD MusicXML 4.0 Partwise//EN" "http://www.musicxml.org/dtds/partwise.dtd">
<!--
  A score that imports with nothing dropped and nothing repaired.

  Hand-written, and deliberately so: this is the input to a reference image, so
  what it has to be is short, stable, and made only of constructs the importer
  fully supports. It exercises every metadata field the summary can show -- a
  work title, a composer, a lyricist, the encoding software -- plus two parts,
  one of them on two staves, and an explicit tempo. If a field stops appearing
  in the summary, the picture of this score is where it shows.
-->
